But cleaning confirm transition: cleaning completed, operator presses cleaningConfirmButton -> automatically starting filling valve. Does pump stop at same scan? If outputs state-based, yes Pump off and Filling on same scan. Good. fillingConfirm -> capping; cappingConfirm -> packing; packingConfirm -> Completion_Light on, Packing_Machine off? State Done no pack output. Need maybe Packing_Machine remains on while light? No, packaging completed so stop. Fine.

Need consider if bottleSensor is level: WaitForBottle triggers on rising edge, state Cleaning; if bottleSensor remains true, no issue. If bottleSensor goes false before cleaning confirm, pump remains due to state. Good.

Could implement as CASE state. Need confirm button edge detection using R_TRIG instances. For bottleSensor use R_TRIG. But what if bottleSensor remains TRUE from startup? R_TRIG.Q true on first invocation if input true after previous FALSE. If initial all false no issue. If later power cycle? no.

