    ST_WAIT_BOTTLE : INT := 0; etc. State variable INT. This avoids TYPE syntax. But enum is nicer. Need ensure standard. We can just use INT and local constants inside VAR. No extra TYPE. Use INT.

Need implement local variables:
VAR
    state : INT := 0;
    trigBottle : R_TRIG;
    trigCleanConfirm : R_TRIG;
    trigFillConfirm : R_TRIG;
