VAR CONSTANT? Place before VAR? In CODESYS, VAR CONSTANT allowed after VAR. Order maybe VAR_INPUT, VAR_OUTPUT, VAR, VAR CONSTANT? Need constants can be in VAR CONSTANT. But if constants in VAR CONSTANT with END_VAR, can be after VAR. It's okay.

Need call triggers:
trigBottle(CLK := bottleSensor);
tmp_bottleRising := trigBottle.Q;
...
For each.

Then state transitions:
CASE state OF
    ST_WAIT:
        IF tmp_bottleRising THEN
            state := ST_CLEANING;
        END_IF;
    ST_CLEANING:
        IF tmp_cleanRising THEN
            state := ST_FILLING;
        END_IF;
    ST_FILLING:
        IF tmp_fillRising THEN
            state := ST_CAPPING;
        END_IF;
    ST_CAPPING:
        IF tmp_capRising THEN
            state := ST_PACKING;
        END_IF;
    ST_PACKING:
        IF tmp_packRising THEN
            state := ST_DONE;
        END_IF;
    ST_DONE:
        IF tmp_finishedRising THEN
            state := ST_WAIT;
        END_IF;
END_CASE

Then outputs:
Pump_Motor := (state = ST_CLEANING);
Filling_Valve := (state = ST_FILLING);
Capping_Machine := (state = ST_CAPPING);
Packing_Machine := (state = ST_PACKING);
Completion_Light := (state = ST_DONE);

